}
```

5. Quick Sort: This algorithm selects a pivot element and partitions the array into two subarrays: elements less than the pivot and elements greater than the pivot. It then recursively sorts each subarray using quick sort.

Time Complexity: O(nlogn) on average (worst case O(n^2))
