```

6. Heap Sort: This algorithm constructs a max heap from the array and then repeatedly extracts the maximum element from the heap and swaps it with the last element in the remaining heap, until the heap is empty and the array is sorted.

Time Complexity: O(nlogn)
Space Complexity: O(1)

